    "Description": "The kernel-rt packages provide the Real Time Linux Kernel, which enables fine-tuning for systems with extremely high determinism requirements.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* kernel: netfilter: ipset: add missing range check in bitmap_ip_uadt (CVE-2024-53141)\n\n* kernel: vsock: Keep the binding until socket destruction (CVE-2025-21756)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
